// ntpsyncui_en.loc - the texts of the NTP Time Sync app in English (ntpsyncui_en.rsc, the
// Language setting). UTF-8: ntpsyncui.rss says CHARACTER_SET UTF8. Every text here is also
// in ntpsyncui_vi.loc, under the same name and with the same %d / %S in the same order.

